  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Online offshore wind course for Colombian government</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upon request of the Colombian Ministry of Mines and Energy, an online offshore wind course of 4 days was organised for 30 civil servants, working in the field of offshore wind development at various governmental institutes.Participants of the Ministry of Mines and Energy, Mining and Energy Planning Unit (UPME), National Infrastructure Agency (ANI), National Hydrocarbon Agency (ANH), General Maritime Directorate (DIMAR), Ministry of Environment, National Authority of Environmental Licenses (ANLA), Chambers of Commerce of Barranquila and Cartagena and ProColombia (Governmental Export Agency) joined.The course was provided by DOB-acadamy, a well known training institute with profound experience in in offshore wind training courses.</narrative>
  </description>
